OL,3,ACruise ship pianist rescued from sea
OL,4,Aafter nine hours in Pacific Ocean
OL,5,
OL,6,FA cruise ship pianist was found
OL,7,Ftreading water around 20 miles (32km)
OL,8,Foff the Californian coast after falling
OL,9,Foverboard, according to US media
OL,10,Freports.
OL,12,FTwo fishermen discovered the Royal
OL,13,FCaribbean employee near Catalina Island
OL,14,Fon Friday and officials believe he may
OL,15,Fhave been in the Pacific Ocean for nine
OL,16,Fhours, according to CBS News, the BBC's
OL,17,FUS news partner.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
