OL,3,ACruise ship pianist rescued from sea
OL,4,Aafter nine hours in Pacific Ocean
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I'm like, 'Yeah, it's a human being.
OL,7,FStop the boat; let's get all of our
OL,8,Flines in," Grant Garrett was quoted as
OL,9,Fsaying, recalling the moment he and
OL,10,FSean Norton spotted him.
OL,12,FThe man, who has not yet been
OL,13,Fidentified, was taken to hospital in a
OL,14,Fstable condition, the US Coast Guard
OL,15,Ftold the BBC, adding it was
OL,16,Finvestigating the incident.
